WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,900
Without any evil intentions

2
00:00:01,040 --> 00:00:02,200
I won’t beat you to death today

3
00:00:02,200 --> 00:00:03,200
My surname is not Qin

4
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:04,400
Uncle Qin, please listen to my explanation.

5
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:05,760
Things are really not what you think

6
00:00:05,760 --> 00:00:07,080
It was a simple accident that time

7
00:00:10,340 --> 00:00:11,540
Don’t explain it clearly to me today

8
00:00:11,540 --> 00:00:17,290
Don't go anywhere, Uncle Qin and Aunt Song

9
00:00:17,290 --> 00:00:18,570
I really didn’t intend to hide it from you.

10
00:00:22,140 --> 00:00:23,820
Isn't this too cruel?

11
00:00:23,820 --> 00:00:25,460
Will our son be okay?

12
00:00:25,460 --> 00:00:26,780
What can happen

13
00:00:26,780 --> 00:00:28,220
Anyway, he has a thick skin.

14
00:00:28,220 --> 00:00:29,900
Take a beating and lie down for a few days at most

15
00:00:29,900 --> 00:00:31,220
This Yan Chou is about to celebrate the New Year

16
00:00:31,220 --> 00:00:32,820
Our granddaughter can’t even go home for the Chinese New Year.

17
00:00:32,820 --> 00:00:33,900
What does this sound like?

18
00:00:34,260 --> 00:00:35,300
Yu Yu is here

19
00:00:35,300 --> 00:00:39,940
Let grandma hug you. I haven’t seen you for so many days. Do you miss grandma? How is it going inside?

20
00:00:40,670 --> 00:00:42,230
Should be done lying down soon
